speaker guide "Sandbox Guide" color 0.45 0.8 1

node start
	say guide "Welcome to the Sandbox. Dig through terrain, push crates around, and break the boulder."
	choice "What can I do here?" tour
	choice "Just let me play." bye
node tour
	add tours 1
	say guide "Hold the right mouse button to look around. The left button digs, the middle one builds."
	say guide "You have heard this before, haven't you?" if tours > 1
	choice "Tell me again." tour
	choice "Thanks!" bye
node bye
	say guide "Have fun!" time 2
	event WelcomeDone
